{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-414107-r4515310","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Nuremberg Gingerbread","sourcePageId":414107,"sourceRevision":"4515310","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T03:08:24Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Nuremberg%20Gingerbread&oldid=4515310","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:32.266Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:German recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using cardamom","Category:Recipes using clove","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using ground ginger","Category:Recipes using hazelnut","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using lemon zest","Category:Recipes using orange","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with images"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"53061ca36c1bcd0975d5c4cd94c34757bbe16b05389d2ee5253e5826365f082d","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary\n| category = Cake recipes\n| servings = 15\n| time = 60 minutes\n| difficulty = 2\n| Image = [[File:Lebkuchen-pile.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n{{recipe}}\n\nRecipe for gingerbread from Germany.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 500 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 250 g granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 150 g [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]], ground\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Cardamom|cardamom]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of ground [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* Grated [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]] of 1 [[Cookbook:Orange|orange]]\n* Grated zest of 1 lemon\n* 200 g [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Hazelnut|hazelnuts]]\n* 50 g lemon flavoring\n* 50 g orange flavoring\n* Gingerbread wafers\n* 1 packet of [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Bring the honey and sugar to the [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] in a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]] while stirring. Remove from the heat and let cool.\n# [[Cookbook:Sifting|Sift]] the flour into a bowl.\n# Stir in the remaining ingredients.\n# Pour the honey mixture, then the baking powder into the flour. Stir and [[Cookbook:Kneading|knead]] the [[Cookbook:Dough|dough]] until it cools down.\n# [[Cookbook:Dough#Rolling|Roll out]] the dough.\n# Cut out the dough, and place on the gingerbread wafers.\n# Decorate with an almond, and transfer to a [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]].\n# Let cool for about a day\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 180 °C for 15–20 minutes\n\n[[Category:German recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cardamom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hazelnut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Nuremberg Gingerbread","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"15","